          {
            "key": "page.4:62400.1becffee",
            "step": 0,
            "script": 4,
            "text": "「……你是怎么知道我名字的？」\n不容轻视的诸神发起意想不到的反击，\n令我脑海中问号不断。",
            "translation": null
          },
          {
            "key": "page.4:62584.e7074fbd",
            "step": 1,
            "script": 4,
            "text": "「也未必永远让你做监视方面的事活」\n昂然自得的一个神发言。",
            "translation": null
          },
          {
            "key": "page.4:62720.febdbd62",
            "step": 2,
            "script": 4,
            "text": "……奇怪，这个连候补都不算的家伙\n是怎么进来的？",
            "translation": null
          }
        ],
        "contextNotice": "Deduplicated observation window; use i18n:context for an actual route transcript.",
        "previousTranslation": null,
        "translation": {
          "parts": [
            {
              "text": "「……你怎么知道我的名字？」不可小觑的诸神突然反将一军，令我满脑子疑问。"
            }
          ]
        },
        "notes": ""
      },
